{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2019-11-28 22:30:00', 'title': 'Tyvyt (Sintilimab Injection) Jointly Developed by Innovent Biologics, Inc. and Eli Lilly and Company Included in the New Catalogue of National Reimbursement Drug List (Nrdl)', 'text': 'Innovent Biologics, Inc. jointly announced with Eli Lilly and Company that the innovative PD-1 inhibitor Tyvyt® (sintilimab injection), co-developed by both companies, is the only PD-1 inhibitor that has been included in the new Catalogue of National Reimbursement Drug List according to the latest announcement from the National Healthcare Security Administration. The inclusion of Tyvyt® (sintilimab injection) to the NRDL demonstrates that the NHSA has recognized its clinical value, patients benefit and novelty among other factors. This will also allow more patients to be able to afford the new immunotherapy drugs to improve their lives.'}
{'symbol': 'MA', 'date': '2019-11-28 22:30:00', 'title': 'PayPal and Mastercard Extend Instant Transfer to International Markets', 'text': 'PayPal announced that it is extending its Instant Transfer solution to Singapore and a number of European countries as part of its long-standing partnership with Mastercard. Through Mastercard Send, PayPal users can transfer funds from their PayPal accounts to eligible Mastercard cards, typically within seconds. PayPal will initially launch Instant Transfer with Mastercard Send in Singapore, followed by multiple European markets.'}
{'symbol': 'SPG', 'date': '2019-11-28 22:30:00', 'title': 'EML Payments US LLC Enters into A Non-Exclusive Multi-Year Agreement with Simon Property Group, Inc. for the Distribution of Multiple Payment Card Products', 'text': 'EML Payments USA, LLC, has entered into a non-exclusive multi-year agreement with Simon Property Group, Inc. (SIMON) for the distribution of multiple payment card products through select Simon shopping malls and B2B distribution channels in the USA. EML expects the GDV to revenue conversion ratio to be materially in line with other Non-Reloadable card programs the group operates. EML is announcing the contract signature.'}
